	(text "Matrix: 5 cols x 4 rows, col2row (ZMK default). Row 3 has thumbs on cols 2-4 only.\nSW1-SW18 are Kailh PG1316S, D1-D18 are 1N4148WS (values hidden on the sheet).\nXIAO is face-down; its 3V3 and 5V pads stay unconnected. GND ties the board's pour to the XIAO.\nThe battery is hand-wired: TP1/TP2 take the cell leads, TP3 is wired to the XIAO's BAT+ back pad.\nH1/H2 are the case's locating-pin holes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
